== the routes, read out of the router ==
  GET /api/links  -  List links
  POST /api/links  -  Save a link
  GET /api/links/{id}  -  One link
  DELETE /api/links/{id}  -  Forget a link
  GET /health

== the schemas, read out of the types ==
  Page: total items
  Link: id url page_title status note tags
  Status: ["Active","Broken"]
  NewLink: url page_title note
  Problem: error detail

== what the compiler derived for Link ==
{"title":"Link","type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"url":{"type":"string"},"page_title":{"type":"string"},"status":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Status"},"note":{"type":"string"},"tags":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["id","url","page_title","status","tags"],"additionalProperties":false}

== the request body of POST /api/links ==
{"description":"the link to save","required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/NewLink"}}}}
[{"bearer":[]}]

== a route nobody described is still in the document ==
{"operationId":"get_health","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}

== the document is valid JSON and says so ==
true
